* {{IPA|en|/ˈmɑnəˌlɑɡ/|a=cot-caught}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|drama|authorship}} A long [[speech]] by one person in a play; sometimes a [[soliloquy]]; other times spoken to other characters.
# {{lb|en|comedy}} A long series of [[comic]] [[story|stories]] and [[joke]]s as an [[entertainment]].
# A long, uninterrupted utterance that monopolizes a conversation.

